.sp
You can see example of how these options are configured at kea4/all\-options.json \%<#\:config-example-kea4-all-options-json>\&.
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
The \fBdefault\-url\fP option was replaced with \fBv4\-captive\-portal\fP in Kea 2.1.2, as introduced by
RFC 8910 \%<https://\:datatracker\:.ietf\:.org/\:doc/\:html/\:rfc8910>\&. The new option has exactly the same format as the
old one. The general perception is that \fBdefault\-url\fP was seldom used. Migrating users should
replace \fBdefault\-url\fP with \fBv4\-captive\-portal\fP in their configurations.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Kea also supports other options than those listed above; the following options
are returned by the Kea engine itself and in general should not be configured
manually.
.SS List of standard DHCPv4 options managed by Kea on its own and not directly configurable by an administrator
.TS
box center;
l|l|l|l.
