.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS The \fBstatistic\-global\-get\-all\fP Command
.sp
The \fBstatistic\-global\-get\-all\fP command retrieves all global statistics recorded
(same as \fBstatistic\-get\-all\fP but omitting subnet statistics). An example
command may look like this:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
    \(dqcommand\(dq: \(dqstatistic\-global\-get\-all\(dq,
    \(dqarguments\(dq: { }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Here is an example response returning all collected statistics:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
