.IP \(bu 2
1 \- error
.IP \(bu 2
2 \- unsupported
.IP \(bu 2
3 \- empty (command was completed successfully, but no data was affected or returned)
.IP \(bu 2
4 \- conflict (command could not apply requested configuration changes because they were in conflict with the server state)
.UNINDENT
.SS interface\-redetect
.sp
This command retrieves the list of detected interfaces after performing
a re\-detect procedure which only adds newly discovered interfaces,
without removing any previously detected interfaces.
This command does not take any parameters.
