.SS lease4\-get\-page
.sp
This command retrieves all IPv4 leases by page.
.sp
Supported by: kea\-dhcp4
.sp
Availability: 1.5.0 (lease_cmds hook library)
.sp
Access: read \fI(parameter ignored in this Kea version)\fP
.sp
Description and examples: see lease4\-get\-page command \%<#\:command-lease4-get-page>
.sp
Command syntax:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
    \(dqcommand\(dq: \(dqlease4\-get\-page\(dq,
    \(dqarguments\(dq: {
        \(dqlimit\(dq: <integer>,
        \(dqfrom\(dq: <IPv4 address or \(aqstart\(aq>
    }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The from address and the page size limit are mandatory.
.sp
Response syntax:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
  \(dqarguments\(dq: {
    \(dqleases\(dq: [
      {
        \(dqclient\-id\(dq: \(dq01:00:0c:01:02:03:04\(dq,
        \(dqcltt\(dq: 1600432232,
        \(dqfqdn\-fwd\(dq: false,
        \(dqfqdn\-rev\(dq: false,
        \(dqhostname\(dq: \(dq\(dq,
        \(dqhw\-address\(dq: \(dq00:0c:01:02:03:04\(dq,
        \(dqip\-address\(dq: \(dq192.168.1.150\(dq,
        \(dqstate\(dq: 0,
        \(dqsubnet\-id\(dq: 1,
        \(dqvalid\-lft\(dq: 4000
      },
      {
        \(dqclient\-id\(dq: \(dq01:00:0c:01:02:03:05\(dq,
        \(dqcltt\(dq: 1600432234,
        \(dqfqdn\-fwd\(dq: false,
        \(dqfqdn\-rev\(dq: false,
        \(dqhostname\(dq: \(dq\(dq,
        \(dqhw\-address\(dq: \(dq00:0c:01:02:03:05\(dq,
        \(dqip\-address\(dq: \(dq192.168.1.151\(dq,
        \(dqstate\(dq: 0,
        \(dqsubnet\-id\(dq: 1,
        \(dqvalid\-lft\(dq: 4000
      }
    ]
  },
  \(dqresult\(dq: 0,
  \(dqtext\(dq: \(dq2 IPv4 lease(s) found.\(dq
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Result 0 is returned when at least one lease is found, 1 when parameters are malformed or missing,
3 is returned if no leases are found with specified parameters.
.SS lease4\-resend\-ddns
.sp
This command resends a request to kea\-dhcp\-ddns to update DNS for an existing lease.
