    \(dqresult\(dq: 0,
    \(dqtext\(dq: \(dqInfo about IPv6 shared network \(aqfloor13\(aq returned\(dq,
    \(dqarguments\(dq: {
        \(dqshared\-networks\(dq: [
        {
            \(dqmatch\-client\-id\(dq: true,
            \(dqname\(dq: \(dqfloor13\(dq,
            \(dqoption\-data\(dq: [ ],
            \(dqrebind\-timer\(dq: 90,
            \(dqrelay\(dq: {
                \(dqip\-address\(dq: \(dq::\(dq
            },
            \(dqrenew\-timer\(dq: 60,
            \(dqsubnet6\(dq: [
                {
                    \(dqsubnet\(dq: \(dq2003:db8:1::/64\(dq,
                    \(dqid\(dq: 5,
                    <many other subnet specific details here>
                },
                {
                    \(dqsubnet\(dq: \(dq2003:db8:2::/71\(dq,
                    \(dqid\(dq: 6,
                    <many other subnet specific details here>
                }
            ],
            \(dqvalid\-lifetime\(dq: 120
        }
        ]
    }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Note that the actual response contains many additional fields that are omitted here for clarity.
