.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This command includes a list with exactly one option specification, comprising an option name, code, and as of Kea 3.1, an optional client\-classes parameter (see Option Class\-tags as Keys \%<#\:cb-cmds-option-class-tags-as-keys>). Specifying an empty list, a value of \fBnull\fP, or multiple server tags will result in an error.
