    }
}
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Operation\-target is optional; default is \(aqall\(aq.
.sp
Response syntax:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
{
    \(dqresult\(dq: <integer>,
    \(dqtext\(dq: \(dq<string>\(dq
}
.EE
