.SS statistic\-global\-get\-all
.sp
This command retrieves all recorded global statistics (omitting subnet statistics).
.sp
Supported by: kea\-dhcp4, kea\-dhcp6
.sp
Availability: 3.1.2 (built\-in)
.sp
Access: read \fI(parameter ignored in this Kea version)\fP
.sp
