.SS statistic\-reset
.sp
This command sets the specified statistic to its neutral value: 0 for integer, 0.0 for float, 0h0m0s0us for time duration, and \(dq\(dq for string type. It takes a single string parameter called name that specifies the statistic name.
.sp
Supported by: kea\-dhcp\-ddns, kea\-dhcp4, kea\-dhcp6
