.UNINDENT
.sp
The reservation\-get\-by\-address command has been called. Parameters passed are logged.
.SS HOST_CMDS_RESERV_GET_BY_ADDRESS_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
reservation\-get\-by\-address command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
