.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The lease4\-add command has been successful. Lease IPv4 address
is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_ADD4_CONFLICT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
