.SS LEASE_CMDS_BULK_APPLY6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-bulk\-apply command successful (applied addresses count: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The lease6\-bulk\-apply command has been successful. The number of applied
addresses is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_BULK_APPLY6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-bulk\-apply command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease6\-bulk\-apply command has failed. Both the reason as well
as the parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_DEINIT_OK
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
unloading Lease Commands hooks library successful
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This info message indicates that the Lease Commands hooks library has been
removed successfully.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_DEL4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-del command successful (address: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The attempt to delete an IPv4 lease (lease4\-del command) has been successful.
Lease IPv4 address is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_DEL4_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-del command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The attempt to delete an IPv4 lease (lease4\-del command) has failed. Both the
reason as well as the parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_DEL6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-del command successful (address: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The attempt to delete an IPv4 lease (lease4\-del command) has been successful.
Lease IPv6 address is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_DEL6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-del command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The attempt to delete an IPv6 lease (lease4\-del command) has failed. Both the
reason as well as the parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_GET4_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-get command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease4\-get command has failed. Both the reason as well as the
parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_GET6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-get command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease4\-get command has failed. Both the reason as well as the
parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_INIT_OK
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
loading Lease Commands hooks library successful
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This info message indicates that the Lease Commands hooks library has been
loaded successfully. Enjoy!
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LEASE4_OFFER_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
processing error occurred evaluating binding variables: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error log is emitted when an error occurs in  the lease4_offer
handler is invoked. The argument provides an explanation.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LEASES4_COMMITTED_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
processing error occurred evaluating binding variables: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error log is emitted when an error occurs in  the leases4_committed
handler is invoked. The argument provides an explanation.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LEASES6_COMMITTED_CONFLICT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
could not updating lease: %1 for: %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error log is emitted by the leases6_committed callback when attempting
to update a lease with new binding\-variable values but a conflicting change
has occurred rendering the update invalid. The arguments provide the lease
address and the query details.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LEASES6_COMMITTED_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
reason: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error log is emitted when one or more leases associated with a client
query failed to be updated with binding\-variable values. The argument
provides details. Individual errors for each lease should precede this log.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LEASES6_COMMITTED_LEASE_ERROR
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
evaluating binding\-variables for lease: %1 for: %2, reason: %3
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error log is emitted by the leases6_committed callback when an
unexpected error occurs evaluating the binding\-variables for a given
lease. The arguments provide the lease address, the query details, and
an error explanation.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_LOAD_ERROR
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
loading Lease Commands hooks library failed: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This error message indicates an error loading the Lease Commands
hooks library. The details of the error are provided as argument of
the log message.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_PATH_SECURITY_WARNING
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease file path specified is NOT SECURE: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This warning message is issued when security enforcement is disabled
and the path portion of the \fIfilename\fP parameter of the lease4\-write
or lease6\-write command does not comply with the supported path. The
server will still use the specified path but is warning that doing so
may pose a security risk.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_RESEND_DDNS4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-resend\-ddns command successful: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
A request to update DNS for the requested IPv4 lease has been
successfully queued for transmission to kea\-dhcp\-ddns.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_RESEND_DDNS4_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-resend\-ddns command failed: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
A request to update DNS for the requested IPv4 lease has failed.  The
reason for the failure is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_RESEND_DDNS6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-resend\-ddns command successful: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
A request to update DNS for the requested IPv6 lease has been
successfully queued for transmission to kea\-dhcp\-ddns.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_RESEND_DDNS6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-resend\-ddns command failed: %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
A request to update DNS for the requested IPv6 lease has failed.  The
reason for the failure is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-update command successful (address: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The lease4\-update command has been successful. Lease IPv4 address
is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE4_CONFLICT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-update command failed due to conflict (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The received lease4\-update is well\-formed and contains valid parameters
but the lease could not be created because it is in conflict with the
server state or configuration. The reason for a conflict is logged in
the message.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE4_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-update command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease4\-update command has failed. Both the reason as well as the
parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-update command successful (address: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 20.
The lease6\-update command has been successful. Lease IPv6 address
is logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE6_CONFLICT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-update command failed due to conflict (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The received lease6\-update is well\-formed and contains valid parameters
but the lease could not be created because it is in conflict with the
server state or configuration. The reason for a conflict is logged in
the message.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_UPDATE6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-add command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease6\-update command has failed. Both the reason as well as the
parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_WIPE4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-wipe command successful (parameters: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease4\-wipe command has been successful. Parameters of the command
are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_WIPE4_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease4\-wipe command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease4\-wipe command has failed. Both the reason as well as the
parameters passed are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_WIPE6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-wipe command successful (parameters: %1)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The lease6\-wipe command has been successful. Parameters of the command
are logged.
.SS LEASE_CMDS_WIPE6_FAILED
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
lease6\-wipe command failed (parameters: %1, reason: %2)
.EE
