.SS PGSQL_LB_GET_SUBID_HWADDR
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
obtaining IPv4 lease for subnet ID %1 and hardware address %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server is attempting to obtain an IPv4
