for the specified subnet identifier.
.SS PGSQL_LB_GET_VERSION
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
obtaining schema version information
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server is about to obtain schema version
information from the PostgreSQL database.
.SS PGSQL_LB_NEGATIVE_LEASES_STAT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
recount of leases returned a negative value
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
This warning message is issued when the recount of leases using counters
in the PostgreSQL database returned a negative value. This shows a problem
which can be fixed only by an offline direct recount on the database.
This message is issued only once.
.SS PGSQL_LB_ROLLBACK
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
rolling back PostgreSQL database
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
The code has issued a rollback call. All outstanding transactions will
be rolled back and not committed to the database.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_CREATE_POOL4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
creating shared\-flq pool for address range %1 \- %2, subnet id %3, recreate %4, capacity %5
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end to
(re)create the shared free lease data for the pool described in the arguments.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_CREATE_POOL6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
creating shared\-flq pool for address range %1 \- %2, type %3, delegated length: %4, subnet id %5, recreate %6, capacity %7
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end to
(re)create the shared free lease data for the pool described in the arguments.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_PICK_LEASE4
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
picking a free lease from address range %1 \- %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
a free address from the pool described in the arguments.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_PICK_LEASE6
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
picking a free lease from address range %1 \- %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
a free lease from the pool described in the arguments.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL4_DELETE
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
delete the V4 SFLQ pool with start address %1 and end address %2, force = %3
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back to delete
the v4 SFLQ pool (and it\(aqs free lease data) that match the given start and end
addresses.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL4_GET_ALL
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V4 SFLQ pools
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
a list of all v4 SFLQ pools.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL4_GET_BY_RANGE
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V4 SFLQ pools that overlap the range %1 and %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
the v4 SFLQ pool that overlap the given address range.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL4_GET_BY_SUBNET
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V4 SFLQ pools for subnet\-id %1
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
a list of all v4 SFLQ pools belonging to a subnet.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL6_DELETE
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
delete the V6 SFLQ pool with start address %1 and end address %2, force = %3
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back to delete
the v6 SFLQ pool (and it\(aqs free lease data) that match the given start and end
addresses
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL6_GET_ALL
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V6 SFLQ pools
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
a list of all v6 SFLQ pools.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL6_GET_BY_RANGE
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V6 SFLQ pools that overlap the range %1 and %2
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Logged at debug log level 50.
This debug message is issued when the server asks the lease back end for
the v6 SFLQ pool that overlap the given address range.
.SS PGSQL_LB_SFLQ_POOL6_GET_BY_SUBNET
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fetch all V6 SFLQ pools for subnet\-id %1
.EE
