This debug message indicates that the GSS\-TKEY exchange receives a message of
specified size.
.SS TKEY_EXCHANGE_RESPONSE_TTL
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
GSS\-TKEY exchange received a response with TTL of: %1 seconds.
.EE
