      |                               |
      +\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+
      |             ...               |
      +\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+
         Figure 1: PAA DHCPv4 option

      option\-code:        OPTION_PANA_AGENT (136).

      option\-length:      Length of the \(aqoptions\(aq field in octets;
                          MUST be a multiple of four (4).

