        \(dqdata\(dq: \(dq192.0.2.66, 192.0.2.67\(dq,
        \(dqname\(dq: \(dqpana\-agent\(dq
      },

      /*
      Code    Len   LoST Server Domain Name
      +\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-\-+\-\-\-\-
      | 137 |  n  |  s1 |  s2 |  s3 |  s4 | s5  |  ...
