      */
      // Type: array of {IPv4 address}
      {
        \(dqcode\(dq: 138,
        \(dqdata\(dq: \(dq192.0.2.68, 192.0.2.69\(dq,
        \(dqname\(dq: \(dqcapwap\-ac\-v4\(dq
      },

      // Option codes 139\-140 are not defined in Kea.

      /*
