        \(dqcode\(dq: 89,
        \(dqdata\(dq: \(dq1, 0, 24, 192.0.2.0, 2001:db8:1::/64\(dq,
        \(dqname\(dq: \(dqs46\-rule\(dq,
        \(dqspace\(dq: \(dqs46\-cont\-mape\-options\(dq
