      +\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+

      o  option\-code: OPTION_S46_V4V6BIND (92)

      o  option\-length: length of the option, excluding option\-code and
