      |       option\-code (136)       |          option\-length        |
      +\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+
      .           bootstrap\-server\-list (variable length)             .
      +\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+\-+

      option\-code: OPTION_V6_SZTP_REDIRECT (136)

      option\-length: The option length in octets.

      bootstrap\-server\-list: A list of servers for the
